      "text": "Transfer from the lodge to the airport and flight from Manaus to Rio de Janeiro. On arrival, transfer to Búzios and check in at your hotel on the tropical coast.\n\nTo use the included transfer, your flight from Manaus must depart after 14:30. An earlier departure requires a private transfer at an additional cost.",
